      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استطفّ</span></b> , said of a camel's hump, <i>It rose,</i> or
<i>became high.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استطفّت حَاجَتُهُ</span>
<i>The thing that he wanted became prepared, and
easy of attainment.</i> (TA.) See also 1, in two
places.

